===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[ˈfɪndn̩]|[ˈfɪndən]}}
* {{audio|de|De-finden2.ogg}}
* {{audio|de|De-finden.ogg}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-finden.ogg|a=Austria}}
* {{rhymes|de|ɪndn̩|s=2}}
* {{hyph|de|fin|den}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|finden<fand,gefunden,fände>}}

# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[find]]; to [[discover]]
#: {{ux|de|Ich habe deine Schlüssel '''gefunden'''.|I '''found''' your keys.}}
# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[think]], to [[consider]], to [[find]] {{+obj|de|acc<someone/something> + predicate&adjective/acc&noun<to be a certain way>}}
